eak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんの早起きの秘訣は？((((^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は起きれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだもねねに起こしてもらた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの時、朝めちゃくちゃ早い時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大音量にしたアラームを1分ごとに何回も設定します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとです、うそじゃないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く寝よう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...て今何時だ。やっべ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんは京都なんだ？( ´ω｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今度は是非、京都で握手会をしませんか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたいよーまた会いたいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/0893491/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんは毎日いちごを食べるの